ed_prompt","name":"enhanced_prompt","type":"STRING","links":[25,26]}],"properties":{"aux_id":"comfyui-minimax-h3-prompt-enhancer-T8","ver":"main","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3PromptEnhancerT8"},"widgets_values":["一个个性模特姐姐被两个学生妹在舞台后场索要签名，并给她们签名。两个学生妹妹非常激动开心，其中一个都激动的流泪了。适当给三个人合适的服装，学生妹都是校服。","Ref2VA（参考图/视频生音视频）",9,"AUTO（系统自动判断）","balanced",0,"English","官方增强","现有兼容（保留中英文）","无（仅核心规则）","无（不使用 T8 案例）","OpenAI兼容接口（备用）","gemini-3.5-flash","","","","","","","",741678319818470,"randomize",true,false,true],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":36,"type":"ShowText|pysssss","pos":[3141.289117607103,223.76919249282298],"size":[446.2804421608098,865.263059316415],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","link":26}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","shape":6,"type":"STRING","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"pysssss.custom_scripts","ver":"1.0.0","Node name for S&R":"ShowText|pysssss"},"widgets_values":["subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1>: The fashion model \"older sister,\" based on the person in <Picture 1>. A young East Asian woman in her early twenties with an ultra-short buzzcut, defined jaw and cheekbones, a calm quietly confident expression, and a tall lean figure. She wears a long camel-colored wool overcoat draped over a hangar behind her, layered over an all-black high-fashion ensemble of a black turtleneck, tailored black trousers, and sleek black boots.\n\n<Subject 2>: Student girl based on the person in <Picture 2>. A young East Asian teenage girl with a short straight black bob haircut and blunt bangs, a soft rounded face, and a gentle bright-eyed expression. She wears a Chinese-style school uniform: white short-sleeved button-up blouse, navy ribbon bow tie, navy pleated knee-length skirt, white knee-high socks, white sneakers, and a navy school backpack on both shoulders.\n\n<Subject 3>: Student girl based on the person in <Picture 3>. A young East Asian teenage girl with long straight dark hair falling past her shoulders, black-framed glasses, a slightly fuller face with faint acne marks on the cheeks, and an earnest emotional expression. She wears the same school uniform as <Subject 2>: white blouse, navy bow tie, navy pleated skirt, white knee-high socks, white sneakers, and navy backpack.\n\n<Picture 1>: Multi-angle character reference sheet showing <Subject 1> from front, three-quarter, profile, and full-body views against a neutral gray studio backdrop; serves as the visual identity anchor for <Subject 1>.\n\n<Picture 2>: Multi-angle character reference sheet showing <Subject 2> from front, three-quarter, profile, and full-body views against a neutral gray studio backdrop; serves as the visual identity anchor for <Subject 2>.\n\n<Picture 3>: Multi-angle character reference sheet showing <Subject 3> from front, three-quarter, profile, and full-body views against a neutral gray studio backdrop; serves as the visual identity anchor for <Subject 3>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A backstage moment at a runway venue where a confident fashion model is approached by two teenage schoolgirl fans asking for an autograph; she signs their notebook with a warm smile while the girls react with overwhelming excitement and one of them breaks into joyful tears.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved\n<Subject 3>: fully_preserved\n<Picture 1>: attribute_transfer\n<Picture 2>: attribute_transfer\n<Picture 3>: attribute_transfer\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe visual style is candid backstage documentary with warm tungsten practical lighting mixing with cool ambient daylight spill, soft shallow depth of field, and gentle handheld camera movement that captures an authentic fan-meets-idol moment.\n\n[Shot 1] A wide establishing shot shows the backstage corridor of a runway venue. Concrete floor, garment racks lined with hanging coat covers, a vanity mirror ringed with warm bulbs, and a small folding table with bottled water and styling tools. Dim tungsten practicals wash the corridor while a cooler bluish daylight spills in from an off-screen exit door. <Subject 1> stands near the table, her camel overcoat hung behind her, dressed in her all-black high-fashion look, arms loosely crossed. From the left of frame, <Subject 2> and <Subject 3> step into the corridor, both in identical navy-and-white school uniforms with backpacks. They spot <Subject 1> and freeze, eyes widening; <Subject 2> instantly thrusts a small fabric-covered notebook forward with both hands while <Subject 3> clutches her friend's sleeve and steps slightly behind her. (S2) speaks in a hushed, trembling Chinese voice, asking for an autograph. (S3) gives a tiny breathless gasp. <Subject 1> looks up, her expression softening into a warm smile, and she nods.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500 The camera pushes in smoothly to a medium close-up of <Subject 1>'s hands as she accepts a black marker and the notebook. She opens to a clean page where a small careful heading has been hand-written by the students. With smooth practiced strokes she signs her name across the page in flowing cursive, then adds a small heart at the end of the signature. In the soft bokeh of the background, <Subject 2> leans forward on tiptoe, whispering rapidly to <Subject 3>; <Subject 3>'s lower lip begins to tremble and a single bright tear rolls down her cheek. <Subject 1> glances up briefly, then gently closes the notebook and holds it back out toward the girls.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.500 A close-up frames <Subject 3> as she accepts the signed notebook with both hands, presses it against her chest, and breaks into a wide trembling smile with tears still spilling from her eyes. <Subject 2> rushes in from screen-right and wraps both arms around <Subject 3> in a tight side-hug, both girls bouncing slightly on their heels with emotion. <Subject 1> stands softly out of focus in the background, lifting one hand in a small gentle wave goodbye. The frame holds on the two girls' tearful smile and embrace as the moment settles.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe backstage corridor hums with distant muffled bass from the main stage beyond a heavy curtain, the soft rustle of garment bags swaying on the rack, and the quiet click of the marker cap. Hushed excited whispers from the two students rise and fall, punctuated by a small breathless sniffle. The pen scratches lightly across paper during the signing, and a soft relieved exhale escapes <Subject 3> as she finally receives the notebook. Footsteps fade down the corridor as the warm intimate moment closes.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":43,"type":"UpscaleModelLoader","pos":[4128.120083879683,8.62878176306829],"size":[315,78],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型名称","name":"model_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"放大模型","name":"UPSCALE_MODEL","type":"UPSCALE_MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[50]}],"title":"Load RealESRGAN x4","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.31.0","Node name for S&R":"UpscaleModelLoader"},"widgets_values":["RealESRGAN_x4.pth"]},{"id":44,"type":"ImageUpscaleWithModelNovramSafe","pos":[4122.825080624473,123.58008975918294],"size":[340,160],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":49},{"localized_name":"upscale_model","name":"upscale_model","type":"UPSCALE_MODEL","link":50},{"localized_name":"novram_safe","name":"novram_safe","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"novram_safe"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"tile_size","name":"tile_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[51]}],"title":"ESRGAN 4x (novram_safe)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImageUpscaleWithModelNovramSafe"},"widgets_values":[true,512]},{"id":46,"type":"VHS_VideoCombine","pos":[4100.055365195934,510.21191